<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-3967] Discovery events can be lost after client reconnect</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3967</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;GridDiscoveryManager uses GridBoundedConcurrentOrderedMap to store discovery events history. When client reconnects this collection is cleared using &apos;clear&apos; method, but for GridBoundedConcurrentOrderedMap this method is not correctly implemented, and after this elements put in this map can be lost.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
